{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"2686","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v7276","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"トシぞー","creatorId":"vndb:s3065","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1339","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3065","name":"トシぞー","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:3808","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"黒崎将弘","creatorId":"vndb:s3066","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:231","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3066","name":"黒崎将弘","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:3809","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"m.c.TOM","creatorId":"vndb:s6343","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6343","name":"m.c.TOM","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:7894","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c18116","characterName":"一ノ瀬 彩音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"149125","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230350"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27447"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18116"},"originalCharacterName":"一ノ瀬 彩音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から主人公に想いを寄せていたが、主人公の気持ちが既に別の女性に向けられていることを知ったことから、自分の想いはずっと胸に仕舞い込んだまま……、しかし、今でもその気持ちは変わっていないようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親の居ない彼女は、ずっと祖母と暮らしていたが、その祖母が亡くなったことをきっかけに「紬女」に立候補したが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27447","sourceWorkId":"2686","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"達哉の生家に程近いところにすんでいた少女で、達哉の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から達哉に思いを寄せていたが、彼の気持ちが他の女性に向いている事を知ってからは、その想いを胸の奥に仕舞い込んできている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し前、彼女を育ててくれたて祖母が亡くなり、天涯孤独の身となったのをきっかけに『紬女』の候補になる事を決意した。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149125"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb0b810efea509dc138a71c22c785f63b7656cbd37d4bb7c666f2b6788a78ec7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c790b187adad174255426cfef269300c9a33721fcc942dd74fbf01ce9ae55f2.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c18117","characterName":"大河内 紗奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"149126","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230350"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27448"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18117"},"originalCharacterName":"大河内 紗奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「紬女」の役をこなした女性は特例を赦されることを知り、閉鎖的な村から出たい一心で、自ら「紬女」に立候補した少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿も端麗なら、頭も良いが、そうしたところ過信しているところがあり、周囲との軋轢を生んでしまうこともしばしば。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27448","sourceWorkId":"2686","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々『紬女』の役をこなした女性は特例を赦される事を知り、閉鎖的な村から逃げ出したくて今回の『紬女』の候補に自ら立候補した少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かな外見とは裏腹に頭の回転が速く、意志も強い。しかし、自分の容姿や能力を過信しすぎるきらいもありその所為で周りと衝突してしまう事がある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149126"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb783d614d5a489bc4f7ee21464d7a4babb7045e3c9d06b7b41ae24ac85568b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c3ff42da57e5fbde8b6dee073fef8f3a74d8d52ee64b72a8b9f96829dfd56dd.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜井 あいな","creatorId":"vndb:s3068","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3068","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3068","name":"桜井あいな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39301","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18549","characterName":"森山 芙彌子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"149127","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230350"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27449"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18549"},"originalCharacterName":"森山 芙彌子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族思いの心優しき少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「紬女」に立候補した理由も、年もゆかない弟や妹、そしてこれまで大家族を養ってきた父親が病気で伏せってしまったことから、自分の食い扶持を減らし、「葛西家」から支払われる金子で家族を養うため。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんくさいところがあり、その所為で損をしてしまうことが多いが、それを補って余りある気立ての良さで、評判も上場。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27449","sourceWorkId":"2686","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し人より出遅れる事が多い少女で、その所為で色々と損をしてしまう事が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそれを補って余りあるくらいの気立ての良さがあり、周りからの受けは悪くない。年下の弟妹達が多く、今まで家計を担ってきた父親が"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病に伏せってしまった為、家族を養う為に『紬女』候補になった少女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149127"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f100f24684be5b8ad22a43e2ee16b6cdda0c18e9c60c186474af03f56947584.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c0096632870b2694fd7961c2e9317eaac09fc3c65e51f7ed38c10196c6d5976.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長田 園","creatorId":"vndb:s1018","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1018","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1018","name":"長田園","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39299","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18550","characterName":"伽澄 綾子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"149124","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230350"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27450"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18550"},"originalCharacterName":"伽澄 綾子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓は辰己綾子。主人公の遠縁にあたり、主人公の初恋の女性にして、初めての女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"10年前の「肌紬」の儀式で、葛西家に赴いた3人の少女の中のひとり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今では村の財政の一端を担う呉服屋の経営を任され、村の収支の全てを把握する立場となった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27450","sourceWorkId":"2686","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧姓は辰己 綾子（たつみ りょうこ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"達哉の遠縁にあたり、初恋の人であり、初めての人。十年前の『肌紬』の際、葛西家に赴いた３人の少女の一人で、今は村の財政を一端を担う呉服屋『かすみ』の経営を任されており、村の収支の全てを把握する立場にいる女性。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149124"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1ca158ad6bc354af0b3c3c3a05d416597455b50ea6688aa009266a4d5f65c77f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5208ab89d4893876af40bd61f4ba3bc1d95bb905067f4452fe00de5a1e3bc1e2.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"つるた 陽美","creatorId":"vndb:s3067","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3067","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3067","name":"つるた 陽美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39300","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127168","characterName":"辰己 達哉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127168"},"originalCharacterName":"辰己 達哉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"s